[{"answer":"Did you notice that our room wasn't cleaned today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was quite surprised when I got back and saw the mess still there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think we should call the front desk or go down there ourselves?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's call them first and see what they say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe they just missed our room by mistake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. I hope they can send someone up soon;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/7.mp3"},{"answer":"it's really not comfortable like this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and let's also remind them about the extra pillows we asked for this morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toeic/conversation-bad-room-service-2024-07-21-17-36-18/9.mp3"}]
